# API & mutations

Public form order (mandatory):

`honeypot → Turnstile → rate limit → validate → service-role insert → email`

Admin resource fields: SQL → types → `resources.ts` → `validate.ts` → revalidate public paths.

| Route | Gate |
|---|---|
| `api/cron/keep-alive` | Bearer `CRON_SECRET` |
| `newsletter/confirm|unsubscribe` | Signed tokens |
| admin exports | Authenticated session |

Browser gets generic failures; logs get real reasons. Do not add email/spam SDKs without approval.
